recent news from New Gothenburg University.

Tension: NGU to inaugurate new Quinn Hall in grand ceremony!

Quinn: Ah, yes! An honor, really, an absolute honor. But I try to support the
university whenever I can. I see it as giving back to the city that's given me
so much. It's heartwarming that they want to name the building after me, truly
heartwarming.

